</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/57900/extras/3afb3792c336b3083fbb14ef2df0ef8c.poster.avif?t=1793991614\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/57900/extras/3afb3792c336b3083fbb14ef2df0ef8c.webm?t=1793991614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/57900/extras/3afb3792c336b3083fbb14ef2df0ef8c.mp4?t=1793991614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
